notes.content:
Hello everyone!
We are here with you the developers of the game "Russian Village Simulator". This game was liked by players and was warmly received in our small community.

And now, after some time, we decided to create a project on a similar theme, namely - the Russian village. But this time the player will go not to the usual village, but to a village that is located on another Red Planet. The game was named "Russian Cyber Village Simulator".

https://store.steampowered.com/app/2800460/

When developing the game we were inspired by "Cyberpunk 2077", "My Summer Car", the series "Cybervillage" and actually our last game "Russian Village Simulator".

[previewyoutube=aDHyQCzlwaE;full][/previewyoutube]

In our game this time you will take on the role of Sergei, a former resident of the cyber village, who returns to his home after several years of absence and finds that the village is in complete desolation and the player will have to deal with its restoration.

The main mechanics of the game are:
- building various structures: houses, bathhouses, barns, fences and the like;
- breeding domestic animals: chickens, cows, goats, pigs, geese, as well as breeding offspring and their further sale;
- hunting and fishing;
- berries, mushrooms;
- harvesting of various resources: wood, stone, etc;
- trading with the locals;
- as well as various story quests to restore the village, help the locals and other dangers that will be waiting for us on this not easy path.

And about the update: we've announced a new game, which means we've started development on the second big update to the current game, which will be released at the end of April..

Greetings to all players of our game!
Releasing a small patch with the following changes:
1. Fixed the display of logs on the map;
2. Corrected the display of mushrooms on the map;
3. Made it possible to zoom the mini map on the mouse wheel;
4. Corrected the collection of vegetables: previously pumpkin for example collected as a tomato;
5. Other minor fixes and improvements.

Hello again, players!
We are posting another update, namely:

1. Water can now not be sold in the store for its cost is now 0 rubles;
2. Corrected canning jars;
3. Corrected the creation of moonshine;
4. Corrected the cooking of food;
5. Simplified harvesting: now you pick up the bags and immediately the vegetables are added to your inventory (we gave up the warehouse). You no longer need to carry 1 bag each :-) (they forgot to remove the mention of bags from the training);
6. Changed the cost of some of the items for better balance;
7. Other small changes and improvements.

Thank you, players, for your ideas. Together we will make the game better!

Hello again, players!
We publish the second patch. We have implemented the following changes and improvements:
1. we added names to the stops of fast movement according to your requests;
2. Removed the ability to enable Vulkan in the game menu;
3. Added support for XeSS Intel (analog of DLSS and FSR);
4. Changed descriptions of some items;
5. Fixed loading of pets, previously they disappeared;
6. Solved the problem with the entrance to the barn;
7. Fixed the navigation of NPCs and their quests:
8. Other minor fixes.

To avoid loading problems, we recommend starting a new game..

As you have noticed, we read all your ideas and try to respond to all your comments and feedback.

Thank you for your ideas for the game.

Hello, dear players!
Having analyzed your feedback and comments we have made a number of changes to the game:
1. Added the display of the icon of the house on the mini map. This icon is displayed on the mini map always, no matter how far you are from home;
2. Improved the functionality of selfies: removed the ability to run, jump and crouch during selfies;
3. Added a "flashlight", called on the F button. When it gets dark, the player will receive a notification to turn on the flashlight;

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44190760/9555391b6d8849b11429d1636bda37d4165ca34f.png

4. Added the ability to roll up the tent and increased the sleep duration to 6 hours;

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44190760/bee0c20f622e07a5d888cf0588f7c0fee66c5dd3.png

5. Added some training triggers;
6. Training signs are available immediately, not after some time as before;
7. Moved the item pickup counter to the center and bottom of the screen, not to the right as it was before:
8. When cracking chests, the icon of the item that was added to the inventory is displayed;
9. Now after some time after the onset of thirst or hunger, the character "passes out";
10. And other minor changes related to textures, characters.

In the future we plan to implement the following:
1. The ability to ride a bike / car / horse. Also quests with their obtaining;
2. Possibility to add greenhouses;
3. Mining iron and melting it down and making different things out of metal and quests related to it;
4. Adding 24 more quests (approximately);
5. Adding girls to the river at your requests;
6. Fishing and quests related to it;
7. New recipes;
8. Buying new real estate;
9. Adding new music and sounds;
10. A map of the village;
11. Addition of small rodents and cats;
12. Addition of new languages;
13. Other minor activities.

To implement all of the above we need your help, namely your feedback on the game, because a small number of reviews lowers our game in the list of other games.

Only your activity is able to support the interest to this game among players and attract the audience to it.

In turn, we will do our best to improve this project and have high hopes for this game.

Thank you very much for your support.
